<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Viewport</span> <span lang="EN-GB">Context Menu</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.663%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>This menu appears when user right clicks with the mouse somewhere on the viewable area or on the scroll bars. Some commands are accessible also via the <u style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="text-decoration:none;">toolbar</span></u>, <a href="view_menu.htm">View Menu</a>, or by <u style="text-decoration:none;"><a href="Shortcut_Keys.htm">shortcut keys</a></u>. This menu contains the following group of commands:</p>
<p class="sub-head">Main Context Menu</p>
<p>This menu is divided in 5 groups:</p>
