</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td width="17.12%" class="whs27">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Static View</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.505%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table">Displays custom number of scan or mesh points in a static scene. The higher the percentage is the more number of points will be displayed.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Static_View.htm"><img src="../Corrosion/Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs30" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
